; TORRE HUNDIDA - UI tiles (ui-designer). BG indices 0-23 (vram_order: ui first, gdd 7.1).
; 24 tiles = the GDD budget. Consecutive runs (code relies on them, APPEND ONLY):
;   FRAME_TL..FRAME_BR (8, order TL T TR L R BL B BR), ICON_HP..ICON_COMPASS (7),
;   AM_WALL..AM_OPEN (7, automap cells in dmap cell-type order, see ui.md).
; BLANK (0) is also the box fill and the "not seen" automap cell (9-piece frame = 8 + BLANK).
; No HUD separator tile: the user prefers no separator line (CABALLERITO/GRIFO).

; ---------------- blank / box fill / unseen map cell (must stay index 0)
@ BLANK
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........

